    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "oAuth2",
        "operation": "sendAndWait",
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "#content-approvals"
        },
        "message": "=*New content ready for review*\n*{{ $('Assemble Record').first().json.Title }}*\nSource: {{ $('Assemble Record').first().json['Source URL'] || 'pasted text' }}\n{{ $('Assemble Record').first().json.Warnings ? '⚠️ ' + $('Assemble Record').first().json.Warnings.split('\\n').join(' · ') : '' }}\n\n*LinkedIn draft*\n{{ $('Assemble Record').first().json['LinkedIn Post'].slice(0, 1500) }}{{ $('Assemble Record').first().json['LinkedIn Post'].length > 1500 ? '…' : '' }}\n\nFull drafts (X thread, Instagram, newsletter, image prompts) are in Airtable:\nhttps://airtable.com/app5QpCvANtfCIxJO/tblFH58bQwABeBi5A/viw71Oz2bgzXmHSu3{{ $json.id }}\n\nApproving publishes the LinkedIn post now. Rejecting archives the record.",
